  <name>Orbolay</name>
  <summary>Quick, small, native, multi-platform Discord overlay alternative</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Quick, small, native, multi-platform Discord overlay alternative.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Voice channel member list and status (who is speaking/muted/deafened/etc)</li>
      <li>Custom notifications</li>
      <li>Mute/deafen/disconnect controls</li>
      <li>User volume control</li>
      <li>Soundboard</li>
      <li>Customizable layout, colors, border radius, etc.</li>
      <li>Works with any official or modded client (including web!)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

